00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:43.800
<v Valdo>Yeah, you have to use different verbs for, you know,
different meanings. I mean, <lang es>quedar</lang>, <lang es>quedar</lang>, <lang es>seguir</lang>.

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:44.800
<v José Luis>Many, many, many verbs in Spanish.

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:49.800
<v Valdo>Yeah, that's the point. In Portuguese,
<lang pt-BR>ficar</lang>, <lang pt-BR>ficar</lang>, <lang pt-BR>ficar</lang>, and that's it.

00:00:49.850 --> 00:00:52.550
<v Michelle>That's the problem!

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:54.300
